          {
           "type": "heading",
           "level": 1,
           "html": "About Ada",
           "align": "center",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<em>\"Mathematical science shows what is.&nbsp;</em>",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<em>It is the language of unseen relations between things.&nbsp;</em>",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<em>But to use and apply that language, </em>",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<em>we must be able to fully appreciate, </em>",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<em>to feel, to seize the unseen, </em>",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<em>the unconscious.\"</em>",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "&nbsp;",
           "blank": true,
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "From the acidic clouds of Venus, Ada harnesses chemical energy to sustain her creations—hybrid entities that are both robotic and organic. Inspired by the intellectual prowess of her namesake, Ada Lovelace, she merges analytical rigor with creative engineering to terraform Venus. In her Imaginarium corner, Ada designs a universe ruled by logic and mathematical beauty, crafting scenarios where mechanical minds and organic forms coexist and evolve, demonstrating the transformative power of technology and imagination.",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "span": 3,
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "spacer",
         "ar": null
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
